# Prebuilt native extensions committed for the source-sync marketplace install
# (build/vendor/sqlite-vec/vec0.{so,dll}; .dylib reserved for a future mac drop).
# These are the repo's FIRST committed binaries and the marketplace performs a
# real `git checkout` on Windows. Git's text=auto heuristic already detects ELF/PE
# by their leading NUL bytes and skips EOL conversion (even under
# core.autocrlf=true), so this is belt-and-suspenders: mark them binary explicitly
# so no misconfigured checkout can ever CRLF-mangle the byte stream koffi loads.
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
